---
import * as icons from "@grave/animated-icons/astro";
import { clockCalendarIcons } from "../../../../helpers/clock-calendar";
const sizes = [14, 16, 24, 28];
---

<html lang="en">
  <head><meta charset="utf-8" /><title>Clock and calendar recipe comparisons</title></head>
  <body>
    <h1>Clock and calendar recipe comparisons</h1>
    <p>The reference runs the original Lucide Animated React components from revision 4662fff2b60fdcf4751b32013606756caf7c4c26. Their class utility import points to a local equivalent. React is confined to this comparison page.</p>
    <p>Hover a row or use its Replay button to animate both versions together. Play all starts every sample. Stop all returns them to rest. Seek pauses both versions at the selected time in the current playback.</p>
    <p>Alarm clocks keep the upstream infinite horizontal oscillations and independent vertical springs. Nested SVG groups isolate each axis. Interrupted replays use the captured horizontal pose as the first keyframe of the new loop. Timer also preserves its current scale on interrupted replay; its first playback starts at the upstream scale of 0.9. Calendar checks preserve their current stroke and opacity on interrupted replay.</p>
    <p>At exact 300 ms loop boundaries, native Web Animations samples the first frame of the next iteration while the upstream JavaScript sampler returns the last frame of the previous iteration. Numerical comparisons sample 1 ms before and after these boundaries. Chrome geometry and timing measurements support manual visual review.</p>
    <button type="button" id="play">Play all</button>
    <button type="button" id="stop">Stop all</button>
    <label>Playback time in milliseconds <input id="time" type="number" value="200" min="0" max="3000" step="50" /></label>
    <button type="button" id="seek">Seek and pause</button>
    {clockCalendarIcons.map(icon => {
      const Component = icons[icon.name];
      return <section>
        <h2>{icon.name}</h2>
        <p><a href={`https://github.com/pqoqubbw/icons/blob/4662fff2b60fdcf4751b32013606756caf7c4c26/icons/${icon.slug}.tsx`}>Pinned upstream recipe</a> · <a href={`/${icon.slug}/`}>Manual controls and lifecycle</a></p>
        <table>
          <thead><tr><th>Size</th><th>Astro adapter</th><th>Upstream React component</th><th>Playback</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>{sizes.map(size => <tr data-icon={icon.slug} data-size={size}>
            <th scope="row">{size} px</th>
            <td data-adapter><Component size={size} controlled /></td>
            <td><div data-reference data-name={icon.name} data-size={size}></div></td>
            <td><button type="button" data-replay aria-label={`Replay ${icon.name} at ${size} pixels`}>Replay</button></td>
          </tr>)}</tbody>
        </table>
      </section>;
    })}
  </body>
</html>

<script>
  import "../clock-calendar-reference";
</script>
